{
  "info": {
    "name": "HU-RBAC-001 / HU-RBAC-004 · ms-identidad",
    "description": "Pruebas de aceptación del control de acceso por roles (matriz + directiva) y de la autorización server-side con política fail-closed. Base local: http://localhost:8089/api/v1 (perfil dev).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8089/api/v1"
    },
    {
      "key": "adminApodo",
      "value": "",
      "description": "Apodo de una cuenta ADMINISTRADOR del entorno. Se rellena al usar la coleccion; no se versiona ningun valor real."
    },
    {
      "key": "adminClave",
      "value": "",
      "description": "Clave de esa cuenta. Igual: se rellena al usar, nunca se versiona."
    },
    {
      "key": "tokenAdmin",
      "value": "",
      "description": "Lo rellena el primer request de la coleccion. No se edita a mano."
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0 · Credencial",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "0 · POST /auth/login · obtener el token de ADMINISTRADOR",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"apodo\": \"{{adminApodo}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{adminClave}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
            "description": "R9.5 — desde que /rbac exige GESTIONAR_CUENTAS, esta coleccion necesita un token de verdad. Se obtiene aqui y se guarda en {{tokenAdmin}} para el resto de los requests. Las credenciales salen de variables vacias en el repositorio: se rellenan al usar la coleccion y no se versiona ningun valor real."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 — la cuenta de administracion existe y la clave es correcta', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const cuerpo = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('tokenAdmin', cuerpo.token || cuerpo.accessToken || '');",
                  "pm.test('el login devolvio un token', () => pm.expect(pm.collectionVariables.get('tokenAdmin')).to.not.be.empty);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "HU-RBAC-001 · Modelo y matriz de permisos",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET matriz · SIN credencial → 403 (R9.5: dejo de ser publica)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/rbac/matrix",
            "description": "Antes de R9.5 este mismo request respondia 200 con las 48 celdas de la politica. El controlador no llevaba ninguna anotacion de permiso, asi que el interceptor ni se activaba."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('403 — la matriz ya no se reparte a quien la pida', () => pm.response.to.have.status(403));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "GET matriz de permisos (48 celdas · Tabla 24)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/rbac/matrix",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}"
              }
            ]
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('trae version y matriz', () => { pm.expect(b).to.have.property('version'); pm.expect(b.matrix).to.be.an('object'); });",
                  "pm.test('4 roles x 12 acciones = 48 celdas', () => {",
                  "  const roles = Object.keys(b.matrix); pm.expect(roles).to.have.lengthOf(4);",
                  "  let celdas = 0; roles.forEach(r => celdas += Object.keys(b.matrix[r]).length);",
                  "  pm.expect(celdas).to.eql(48);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Default-Deny: JUGADOR no puede BANEAR_DEFINITIVAMENTE', () => pm.expect(b.matrix.JUGADOR.BANEAR_DEFINITIVAMENTE).to.eql('DENIED'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "GET catálogo de roles",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/rbac/roles",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}"
              }
            ]
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('4 roles oficiales', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.have.lengthOf(4));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "POST authorize · JUGADOR / BANEAR_DEFINITIVAMENTE → DENIED",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"role\": \"JUGADOR\",\n  \"action\": \"BANEAR_DEFINITIVAMENTE\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/rbac/authorize"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK (evaluación)', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('permitted = false', () => pm.expect(b.permitted).to.be.false);",
                  "pm.test('permissionType = DENIED', () => pm.expect(b.permissionType).to.eql('DENIED'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "POST authorize · ADMINISTRADOR / BANEAR_DEFINITIVAMENTE → GRANTED",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"role\": \"ADMINISTRADOR\",\n  \"action\": \"BANEAR_DEFINITIVAMENTE\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/rbac/authorize"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('permitted = true', () => pm.expect(b.permitted).to.be.true);",
                  "pm.test('permissionType = GRANTED', () => pm.expect(b.permissionType).to.eql('GRANTED'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "POST authorize · MODERADOR / SUSPENDER_USUARIOS → TEMPORARY",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"role\": \"MODERADOR\",\n  \"action\": \"SUSPENDER_USUARIOS\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/rbac/authorize"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('permitted = true (suspensión temporal)', () => pm.expect(b.permitted).to.be.true);",
                  "pm.test('permissionType = TEMPORARY', () => pm.expect(b.permissionType).to.eql('TEMPORARY'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "HU-RBAC-004 · Autorización server-side (Fail-Closed)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /admin/ban · SIN credencial → 403",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{ \"userId\": \"42\" }"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/ban"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('403 Forbidden (fail-closed)', () => pm.response.to.have.status(403));",
                  "const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Problem Details RFC 7807', () => { pm.expect(b).to.have.property('type'); pm.expect(b.status).to.eql(403); pm.expect(b).to.have.property('instance'); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /admin/ban · rol JUGADOR (X-User-Role) → 403",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-User-Role",
                "value": "JUGADOR"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-User-Name",
                "value": "atacante"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{ \"userId\": \"42\" }"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/ban",
            "description": "Con el respaldo apagado (R9.5) este 403 sale por 'HEADER_ROL_DESHABILITADO' en vez de por 'FORBIDDEN_ROLE'. Los dos son fail-closed y los dos quedan auditados; el motivo se ve en la bitacora del servicio."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('403 — rol sin permiso para la acción', () => pm.response.to.have.status(403));",
                  "pm.test('detail = No tienes permiso para esta acción', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().detail).to.eql('No tienes permiso para esta acción'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /admin/ban · JWT con firma corrupta → 403",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiJ9.PAYLOAD_FALSO.FIRMA_INVALIDA"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{ \"userId\": \"42\" }"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/ban"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('403 — token rechazado antes de evaluar permiso', () => pm.response.to.have.status(403));",
                  "pm.test('detail = Token de autenticación inválido o expirado', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().detail).to.eql('Token de autenticación inválido o expirado'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /admin/ban · X-User-Role ADMINISTRADOR sin token → 403 (R9.5)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-User-Role",
                "value": "ADMINISTRADOR"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-User-Name",
                "value": "admin_demo"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{ \"userId\": \"42\" }"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/ban",
            "description": "R9.5 — este request se llamaba 'dev backdoor -> 200' y pasaba. El perfil dev traia app.seguridad.permitir-header-rol=true fijo, y el CD arranca ms-identidad con ese perfil: en el host de dev bastaba con mandar esta cabecera para ejecutar una accion administrativa sin ningun token. Ahora el respaldo viene apagado y solo se enciende a proposito con RBAC_PERMITIR_HEADER_ROL=true. Con el encendido, este request vuelve a dar 200 — es la comprobacion de que el respaldo sigue existiendo para demos locales, no de que la puerta siga abierta."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('403 — la cabecera sola ya no acredita un rol', () => pm.response.to.have.status(403));",
                  "pm.test('el problema es de acceso, no de servidor', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.below(500));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "PUT /rbac/usuarios/2/rol · rol JUGADOR → 403",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-User-Role",
                "value": "JUGADOR"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-User-Name",
                "value": "x"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{ \"nuevoRol\": \"MODERADOR\" }"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/rbac/usuarios/2/rol"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('403 — asignar rol es exclusivo de SUPER_ADMINISTRADOR', () => pm.response.to.have.status(403));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}